<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine c. bank offer more rrps at lower rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine c. bank offer more rrps at lower rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank said on Monday it is offering term reverse repos of up to one-month at a lower rate following the three percentage-point cut in its overnight borrowing rate to 22.</p>
<p>It is selling four-day, two-week, and one-month reverse repos at 15 percent.  </p>
<p>Previously, the rate on these term reverse repos was at 18 percent.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (63 2) 841-8937</p>
</text>
